        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "After having second and even third looks, I can not see an easy way to have this fixed. Computation based on the window width is bound to be problematic for various reasons (multi-byte characters, tab expansion, etc.).\r\n\r\nSo I am afraid I am going to close this issue as \"would be good to fix but I don't think this is possible in reasonable way\". If anyone will have a doable idea or if there will be a new Neovim function/interface to simplify this, feel free to comment here.",
